counter.  For instance, we could make a monitored version of the @code{sqrt}
function:

@example kotlin
val s = makeMonitored @{ x: Double -> sqrt(x) @}

s.call(100.0)
// => 10.0

s.howManyCalls()
// => 1
@end example
@end quotation

